[size=4]Cooking and storage, start to end game[/size]

[b]Farmer's Delight[/b] and its addons (End, Nether, Cultural Delight) give farming an actual reason to exist, and [b]Create: Central Kitchen[/b] ties cooking straight into Create's automation.

Storage follows the same early-to-late curve: Sophisticated Storage and Sophisticated Backpacks carry you through the early and mid game, then [b]Applied Energistics 2[/b] takes over for late-game automated storage, linked into Create's belts and contraptions rather than sitting next to them.

[size=4]Support[/size]

Steamon is made purely for fun, like the rest of the Steamon SMP community. We work on it in our free time, with no sponsors, and it's whitelist-only. If you find a bug or have an idea, open an issue on the GitHub repo and we'll get to it when we can. If you want to help us keep working on it, you can support the project on [url=https://ko-fi.com/gazai]Ko-fi[/url]. No in-game advantages, ever.

[size=4]Credits[/size]

[size=1]Every mod, resource pack and shader here is the work of its own author. Please support them on their own Modrinth and CurseForge pages too.[/size]
[size=1]Steamon isn't affiliated with Pokemon, Minecraft, Mojang, Microsoft, or the Cobblemon and Create teams. We're just big fans of what they've built, and we think they do an amazing job.[/size]
[size=1]A Create x Cobblemon modpack: Cobblemon x Create, Create and Cobblemon, Cobblemon and Create.[/size]
